  "description": "Security Event Tokens (RFC 8417) for .NET with Subject Identifiers (RFC 9493), push (RFC 8935) and poll (RFC 8936) delivery, and OpenID Back-Channel Logout. Build, sign, deliver and validate security events between identity providers and relying parties.",
  "iconFile": "Abblix.png",
  "id": "Abblix.SecurityEvents",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-05T11:15:59.983Z",
